WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:06.980
Previously on 
The Reflection

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.590
What in the world...

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.020
Who...

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.040
Who are you?

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.210
Ethan Everts.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:35.280
Perhaps I'll look more familiar in this form.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.130
Wraith...

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.650
3 Years Ago

00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:00.660
3 Years Ago
Baltimore, America 
2:00 AM

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.710
Eleanor is... Wraith?

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:49.920
My little sister was in the way.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:51.550
Sister?

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.880
If I hadn't removed all 
remnants of her from me,

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.860
I could have never made 
this great power mine.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.680
That's why I had her disappear.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:09.650
But for that to happen, I needed 
her to wish for that herself...

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.100
For her to give herself completely to me.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.880
There's no need to be sad.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:19.490
She has found her life's true meaning...

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:23.200
By becoming a part of the Darkness.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.200
Darkness...

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:29.510
Oh, yes. I need to thank you.

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:35.900
It's because of you that she was 
able to know her true self.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.950
She believed in you.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:43.970
She projected her ideals onto 
what lay under that mask...

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:47.190
That she was someone special.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.080
But then she finally realized...

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.500
that you were sneering at her

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.060
from under the mask that 
you would never remove.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.580
All that remained was the harsh reality

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.470
that she was powerless and had nothing.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:06.360
But I didn't abandon her.

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.900
I gave her meaning.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:13.490
I reached out my hand, and she took it.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:17.640
X-On, it's all thanks to you.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:20.830
That's why I invited you here...

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:23.630
Because I wanted you to witness that.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:28.640
What have I...

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.900
Now, let us begin.

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:20.940
Holy crap.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.330
They're super fluffy.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.190
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.790
Is this all you need to do 
for a wake-up call?

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.190
We haven't even gone to bed.

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:31.510
Wow, it's so pretty!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.650
Well, I guess this is pretty...

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.990
Wait, what just happened?

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.190
Where are we?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.440
Ukki, did you do something?

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.770
Do? What could I have done?

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.830
This must be some kind of prank.

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.150
This is...

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:43.590
The desert?

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:51.530
All of these Reflected...

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.330
There are so many.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:00.990
<i>Ian, tell me your current location.</i>

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.830
There's nothing to tell except 
that all I can see is desert.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.510
<i>As I thought. I've assessed the situation.</i>

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.520
You've changed quite a bit.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.600
A lot's happened.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.400
Figure anything out?

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.490
Switch to speaker.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.140
<i>It appears that, due to some power,</i>

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:46.610
<i>the approximately 500 Reflected 
that were in North America</i>

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:52.260
<i>have been instantly transported 
to White Sands, New Mexico.</i>

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.020
Why here?

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.420
And for what?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.220
Oh! That must mean Eleanor is also...

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.980
Hey... Are those...

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:26.670
Nina...

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:29.730
I remember...

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:34.820
When I was little, we were having a 
barbecue in a yard somewhere.

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:38.720
She ate my onions, since I hated them...

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:47.900
That's the person we couldn't 
save in San Antonio.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:54.300
I disappeared in my mom's arms...

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.330
And when I realized it, I was 
in a town I'd never seen.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.390
And now, here...

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:03.580
Where's my mom? Hey, where's my mom?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:04.700
Where's Mom?

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.730
It appears that the Allen women

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:17.680
received the power of teleportation 
during the Reflection.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:23.680
They needed as many Allens as they 
could get to teleport all these people.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.680
That's why they kidnapped them.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:29.330
The price they paid for their power was...

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.780
That's unforgivable. I won't let 
them get away with this!

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:53.160
That's...

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.210
Wraith.

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:07.720
Nina, run as far away as you can.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.230
What do you mean?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.230
This is going to become a battlefield.

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:33.460
Who the hell is that?

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:37.140
Are you the jerk that brought us here?

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:39.660
Hey! Take us back home!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:40.530
Yeah!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.310
Wait.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:50.180
I told you. A lot's happened.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:56.220
Don't you want to know what his next move 
will be? And what he's trying to do?

00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:00.240
I only care about defeating him.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.320
Just wait.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:18.760
I'm surprised you managed to 
gather all these guys here.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:21.850
It appears we ended up with some 
unwanted guests as well, but...

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:27.680
It was hard to differentiate between the 
actual targets and those in their vicinities.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.430
Say something!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.910
You can't be serious!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.080
Shut your mouth!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:36.230
Mock Lord Wraith one more time, 
and you'll have to deal with me!

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:40.440
I don't know who Wraith is. 
Who the hell does he think he is?

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.510
Who the hell are you?!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:44.810
Hey!

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:46.070
Take us home!

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:52.290
Silence. I ask that you calm down.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:55.040
Please quiet down.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.970
Is there anyone among you who can answer

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:16.310
why, exactly, we came to exist 
on that day three years ago?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.820
What was the Reflection?

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:37.180
Why must we be treated 
with contempt by others,

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:40.140
while they look away and pity us?

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:44.840
Is our only option to remain hidden?

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.840
This many of us must hide from the world?

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.600
Where could such a place be?!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:55.600
Then we should just kill the bastards 
who discriminate against us!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:59.570
Yeah! Let's show them our true power!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:01.050
Fight?

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:06.110
Us? When our numbers are far 
fewer than those of humanity?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.610
We don't stand a chance!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:17.120
We must change the world into 
one in which we can live!

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.880
Into a world of Darkness!

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:25.880
Darkness?

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:31.040
For that to happen, we need 
to offer up our powers.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:36.890
Why were we born? Because 
we have a greater meaning!

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:41.400
You were gathered here 
because you have meaning!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:53.910
Change the world? How? 
What's the point of that?

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:58.320
I'm somehow making things 
work in this world.

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:00.920
I don't have time for a megalomaniac!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:05.300
I have a meeting tomorrow. 
I'll be going home now.

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.130
We're going, too.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.470
Yeah.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.660
Oh, that's me.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:42.740
This number contacted me before.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.040
It's you, isn't it?

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:48.300
I'm not the owner, but I'm the 
one answering right now.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:52.150
You're in New Mexico, right? 
In White Sands.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:57.540
Our satellites noticed that many 
people showed up there at once,

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.300
and we knew they must be Reflected.

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.310
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.090
You need to get away from 
there as soon as you can.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:05.360
The army is...

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.200
This situation is out of our hands now.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.370
It depends on how the government sees them.

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.910
Well, we already know that answer.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:17.660
X-On...

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:20.870
Oh, yeah, I see them. They're here.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.850
Well, see ya.

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:37.470
<i>We are with the United States Army.</i>

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.460
<i>Do not resist, and obey our orders.</i>

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:44.300
<i>We would like you to leave 
this area immediately.</i>

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.800
<i>We mean you no harm.</i>

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:50.140
<i>I repeat. We are with the United States Army.</i>

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.490
<i>Do not resist, and obey our orders.</i>

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:56.820
<i>We would like you to leave 
this area immediately.</i>

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.830
<i>We mean you no harm.</i>

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.370
Not good.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.330
At this rate, he'll get exactly what he wants.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.250
Let's go!

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.960
H-Hey, wait!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.800
<i>Don't try to stand against us!</i>

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.830
Follow our orders, and—

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.120
Damn it... How dare you?!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.500
How did it come to this?

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:47.140
What did we ever do to you?!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:00.990
Wait!

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.230
Please calm down!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.220
Let's do this! Let's crush them!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:24.490
Vy!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.570
I believe it is about time.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:40.200
More... More...

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.880
Let darkness wash over them more.

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:52.820
<i>The Brightstars are the ones who 
were enveloped by the light.</i>

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:55.040
<i>Is their rage causing this?</i>

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:59.590
<i>To deal with their hatred toward those 
who are trying to crush the Reflected,</i>

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:00.880
<i>they go to the darkness.</i>

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.360
It was all to create this situation!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.890
I told you!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.140
This is exactly what he wants!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.160
We'll find Eleanor, no matter what.

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:21.150
We'll get her back.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.160
X-On...

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.080
But right now, we have to stop this fighting!

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.830
Big Wheel! Fly!

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:43.920
Stop!

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:55.940
Stop!

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.530
Don't make this worse!

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:03.280
Jeez... I'm trying to protect you guys!

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:09.370
Vy, be sure you don't overdo it.

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.860
You meddling fools that dilute the darkness...

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.580
Flaming Fury.

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:18.440
Beast Thing.

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.260
Harden.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.470
Volt.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.170
Liquid Terror.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.470
Steel Ruler.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:46.750
Chain lightning!

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:51.910
This isn't good, right?

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:55.410
We're finally supposed to have 
our free day tomorrow.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.580
This isn't how I wanted to spend it!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:01.920
If we're dragged into this, that's the last 
thing we'll need to worry about.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.670
Man, talk about crappy luck!

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:06.180
Actually, it might not be so bad.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:15.890
Let's go, everyone.

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:20.520
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:23.030
I had a little trouble getting changed.

00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:41.170
Good grief.

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:05.650
Darkness,

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:08.200
come to my hands.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
The Reflection

00:24:48.170 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
